From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Share original SAnim bone-channel interpolation and fallback
Upstream-base: c7b2e663f878d38dc429ab12ee7db451daf0c217

Share the existing rotation, translation, scale and multiplicative scale bodies
between original console methods and the checked native retained-pose sink.
Preserve decoder calls, per-key weights, mirror and fallback ordering. Native
bounds checks precede pointer lookup; singleton and rounded terminal samples
use the existing last-key path instead of reading a nonexistent following key.
Share the controller's unmapped identity blends and direct translation store;
no controller, morph, root-motion, callback or replay implementation is selected.

